the weekly podcasts

00:23:49.930 --> 00:23:51.900
we do at the Constitution
Center called "We The People"

00:23:51.900 --> 00:23:54.180
where every week I call
up a leading liberal

00:23:54.180 --> 00:23:57.170
and conservative scholar and
